- 11. The name, brand, and label of the soil amendment(s) in question;

- 12. A statement about whether the soil amendment(s) contain(s) any industrial by-product or sewage sludge as defined in Sec. 2.1;

- 13. Proof that the soil amendment has been registered with the Commissioner of Agriculture as required by 0.C.G.A. § 2-12-73 and a copy of the most recent registration form;

